  "description": "Layla AI — Step Into Interactive Story Worlds\n\nLayla AI is an AI-powered interactive experience. Every character lives in their own cinematic world, with animated video backgrounds, expressive voices, and branching storylines that respond to your choices. It's not just reading a story — you're exploring one.\n\nAll characters, dialogue, and scenes in Layla AI are fictional and generated by artificial intelligence, created purely for entertainment and creative storytelling.\n\nLayla AI gives you the space to meet fictional characters, explore their worlds, and shape the story your way.\n\nIMMERSIVE STORY WORLDS\n• Cinematic video backgrounds bring every character card to life\n• Visual-novel-inspired dialogue interface with expressive scene transitions\n• Rich fictional personalities, backstories, and story arcs\n\nSTORY PROGRESSION SYSTEM\n• Unlock new chapters and scenes through your interactions\n• Every choice you make shapes how the storyline evolves\n• Discover multiple narrative branches and endings\n\nSCENE-TO-IMAGE CREATION\n• Turn story moments into beautifully illustrated scenes\n• Save your favorite scenes as visual keepsakes\n• All generated artwork is filtered for safety and appropriateness\n\nVOICED STORYTELLING\n• Hear characters speak their lines with natural, expressive AI voices\n• Hands-free listening mode for a smoother reading experience\n\nSTORY JOURNAL\n• Track key milestones and turning points across your storylines\n• Keep a private journal of your favorite scenes and chapters\n\nCONTENT SAFETY & COMMUNITY STANDARDS\n• AI-generated content is filtered to prevent inappropriate material\n• In-app reporting tools for any objectionable content\n• Clear community guidelines and user controls\n• Recommended for users 17+\n\nAI-GENERATED CONTENT NOTICE\nAll character dialogue, scene illustrations, and voice narration in Layla AI are generated by artificial intelligence. All characters are fictional and do not represent real people. AI-generated content may be imperfect and is provided for entertainment and creative purposes only. Layla AI does not provide emotional, medical, psychological, or professional advice.\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.laylachat.ai/terms-of-service\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.laylachat.ai/privacy-policy\nSupport: contact@dalaplay.com\n\nReady to step into the story? Download Layla AI and explore worlds full of characters waiting to be discovered.",
